MOUSE 2 20.000 20.000
MOUSE 4 20.000 20.000
COMMAND JoinTrack
MOUSE 1 19.000 20.025
MOUSE 2 19.000 20.025
MOUSE 4 19.000 20.025
MOUSE 1 21.000 20.025
MOUSE 2 21.000 20.025
MOUSE 4 21.000 20.025
